WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background: #000000; }
::cue(.narrator) { color: #FFFF00; }

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200 line:85% align:center
GENTLE PIANO MUSIC

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.997 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Every child is born
curious about sound.</c>

3
00:00:04.997 --> 00:00:07.548 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>But real instruments
can feel too hard...</c>

4
00:00:07.548 --> 00:00:10.847 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>...and most music toys, too simple.</c>

5
00:00:10.847 --> 00:00:16.372 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Meet Melody Mate. A music toy
for children aged three to six.</c>

6
00:00:16.372 --> 00:00:20.886 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Nine instrument tokens.
Each with its own voice.</c>

7
00:00:20.886 --> 00:00:24.908 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Place one on the toy,
and it begins to play.</c>

8
00:00:24.908 --> 00:00:27.379 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Soft touch zones move
with the rhythm,</c>

9
00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:30.362 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>so children can feel the music.</c>

10
00:00:30.362 --> 00:00:35.536 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>A friendly guide leads the way,
through Create, Learn, and Challenge.</c>

11
00:00:35.536 --> 00:00:38.556 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Melody Mate.
Music you can touch.</c>

